On the practice files in this repository

1. These files are practice material for *Claude Code for Non-Developers*,
   Volumes 1 and 2. Readers may use them freely to learn and may adapt them
   for their own work without restriction.

2. Redistributing the files as they are, or in substantially the same form,
   and selling them, are not permitted. Nor may they be used as the material
   accompanying a paid course or textbook.

3. The book text, tables, and figures, together with the prompts, tables,
   checklists, and glossary in the reader resource pack, are not part of this
   repository and remain the copyright of the author.

4. Everything here is synthetic practice material. The company names, people,
   contact details, and amounts are invented and match no real ones. Check the
   current text of any standard or statute before applying it to real work.

5. This material is for learning and reference. No outcome is warranted, and
   the author and publisher accept no liability for the results of applying it.
